docs/fse-comparison-pods.md:121:Raw-mean fse heads already fold internally. Standalone save changes persistence and retained memory, not the folding algorithm. The script records folded-file bytes beside raw-encoder plus linear-head bytes. Floating-point accumulation order can change between folding and explicit matmul, so accuracy and label disagreements are retained. The expanded whole pod has a 150-minute hard limit, including setup, and exports partial results. Its additional stages and budget are specified below. No existing comparison is replaced.
